{
  "description": "Minor works to listed building including to chimney stack including replacing later chimney pots comprising lining of 4 of 8 flues so they could be used, second floor works to replace tired flooring with age appropriate reclaimed equivalent, first floor works to replace tired flooring with age appropriate reclaimed equivalent, ground floor works replace later engineered flooring with age appropriate reclaimed equivalent, and works to staircase to replace tired treads. \r\rRefurbishment of modern shower rooms on first floor, and of basement to damp proof whole and to partially restore original layout. Moving kitchen from front to back of house and installing wood burning stove to flue at front. Removal of chimney breast at back of house (at basement level only) and installation of steel H beam. Installing glass fire approved door to staircase well and fire doors to utility rooms. Replacing later engineered flooring with age appropriate reclaimed equivalent. \r\r",
